Blog 1: My Web Development Journey
I started learning web development as a beginner with no prior experience. First, I learned HTML to create simple web pages. Then I explored CSS to design and style my websites. After that, I started learning JavaScript to make my websites interactive.
This journey has helped me improve my creativity and problem-solving skills. I am still learning new things every day.
📝 Blog 2: Importance of Web Designing
Web designing is very important in today’s digital world. A well-designed website attracts users and provides a better user experience.
Good design helps users easily navigate and understand the content. Web designing is an essential skill for students and developers.
📝 Blog 3: My First Project Experience
My first project was a hotel management website called Tamarind Tree Hotel. I used HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to build it.
In this project, I learned how to create layouts, add images, and design a booking form. This project increased my confidence and interest in web development.
